Tags and Resource Locks

Tags are used for the purpose of organising our Azure resources. Each tag consists of two components : Name and value 
up to 50 tags


There are two types of locks : Read-only and delete
Read-only : Cant modify
Delete : Can modify but cant delete


If lock is applied at  resource level the resource group and resource also will inherit the same.

